WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.062
I choose Download This Link.

00:00:03.487 --> 00:00:05.688
Downloads shows the new item in my queue.

00:00:08.891 --> 00:00:12.208
I highlight video links, then choose Download Selected.

00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:16.648
Downloads shows the selected videos joining my queue.

00:00:18.899 --> 00:00:22.609
Now I choose Download All. New items appear in Downloads

00:00:22.609 --> 00:00:24.093
as the search continues.

00:00:32.153 --> 00:00:36.111
In Downloads, I filter to active jobs and watch their progress.

00:00:40.923 --> 00:00:44.678
Tutorials explains how to download all or selected items.

00:00:46.899 --> 00:00:50.628
In Settings Lite, I can choose video quality and the app's appearance.

00:00:54.406 --> 00:00:57.616
In Pro, choose a folder and how many downloads run

00:00:57.616 --> 00:00:59.542
at once. Batches can finish faster.
